		{
			dependencies: ["1993F92869A4278F"]
			description: ["Fresh r-process matter keeps decaying and giving off heat. The &6Decay Heat Vault&r burns a sealed capsule for power, and its power is local to the site. A UIV hull, the UIV casing and the neutron star site casing, and the generator recipes the controller runs. Site power for the star, so the machines there do not wait on the wireless grid. Capsules by ME; the ash goes back to the platinum plant."]
