		{
			dependencies: ["1E0EB4DDEE39CB3B"]
			description: ["Drop a probe into the ergosphere and read how fast the hole spins. The probe does not come back, and nobody needs it to. The &6Ergosphere Probe Bay&r also loads the sleds. A UIV hull and the UIV casing, with a drop rail. Probe data for the Kerr chart, and loaded sleds for the Penrose engine. Probes by ME; send the data home, since it is the only thing that returns."]
